en_US:
That raised walkway...{VAR BE01}
If you stand still, you'll fall off, so you
have to keep moving.

Oh! Bold enough to come talk to me,
are you?{VAR BE01}
You're quite the Trainer. I like you!
Take this TM!{VAR BE01}

Now, now, child, don't you go heading into
the tall grass.{VAR BE00}
That Pokémon might be too much for you.{VAR BE01}

We'll catch cold standin' around talkin'
in this wind and rain.{VAR BE01}
It's not much, but come stay
in my home a spell.{VAR BE01}

Trainer Tips!{VAR BE01}

The number of Exp. Points you get
after a battle is based on levels.{VAR BE01}
When your Pokémon is weaker than
its opponent, it will get more.{VAR BE01}
But if your Pokémon is stronger,
it won't get as many.
